# Only matters for CLI deploys (`vercel deploy` / `vercel build`). Git-integration
# builds clone the repo and never see these. Without this file the CLI tried to
# upload the whole working tree — 7.6 GB, mostly catalog/ — on 2026-10-12.
# Patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED on purpose: an unanchored `catalog/` also matched
# `.next/server/app/(dashboard)/catalog/` and broke `vercel deploy --prebuilt`.
# node_modules/ and .next/ are ignored by default; never list them here.
/catalog/
/docs/
/Claude outputs/
/scratch/
/tmp/
/.playwright-mcp/
/*.log
.DS_Store
